  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Clara appelle chez Noy.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແມ່ບົວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຮັນໂລ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສະບາຍດີແມ່ ນ້ອຍຢູ່ບໍ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແມ່ບົວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບໍ່ຢູ່ ອອກໄປແລ້ວ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບອກລາວໂທຫາຂ້ອຍແດ່</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແມ່ບົວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໄດ້ ແມ່ນໃຜນໍ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຄລາຣາເຈົ້າ</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Romanisation (mots nouveaux)</summary><p><span class=\"rom\">Hán-lóo.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Sā-bǎay-dǐi mɛ̄ɛ. Nɔ̏ɔy yùu bɔ̌ɔ?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̀ɔ yùu. Ɔ̏ɔk pǎy lɛ̏ɛw.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̏ɔk láaw thóo hǎa khɔ̂ɔy dɛ̀ɛ.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Dâay. Mɛ̄ɛn phǎy nɔ́ɔ?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Clara jâo.</span></p></details><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Mme Boua</b> — Allô.<br><b>Clara</b> — Bonjour madame. Noy est là ?<br><b>Mme Boua</b> — Non, elle est sortie.<br><b>Clara</b> — Dites-lui de me rappeler, s&#x27;il vous plaît.<br><b>Mme Boua</b> — D&#x27;accord. C&#x27;est de la part de qui ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Clara.</p></details>"
